质文化遗产，感受千年传承的文化魅力\n              - generic:\n                - generic:\n                  - textbox:\n                    - /placeholder: 搜索非遗项目...\n                - combobox:\n                  - generic: 全部类别\n                  - img\n                - combobox:\n                  - generic: 全部地区\n                  - img\n                - combobox [expanded]:\n                  - generic: 按名称\n                  - img\n              - paragraph: 共 8 个非遗项目\n              - generic:\n                - generic:\n                  - generic:\n                    - img\n                    - generic: 民俗活动\n                    - generic:\n                      - heading [level=3]: 春节\n                      - paragraph: Spring Festival\n                  - generic:\n                    - generic:\n                      - img\n                      - generic: 北京 · 华夏大地\n                    - paragraph: 春节是中国最重要的传统节日，承载着团圆、祈福、辞旧迎新等丰富的文化内涵。\n                    - link:\n                      - /url: /heritage/spring-festival\n                      - text: 了解详情\n                      - img\n                - generic:\n                  - generic:\n                    - img\n                    - generic: 民俗活动\n                    - generic:\n                      - heading [level=3]: 端午龙舟\n                      - paragraph: Dragon Boat Racing\n                  - generic:\n                    - generic:\n                      - img\n                      - generic: 广东 · 楚地遗风\n                    - paragraph: 龙舟竞渡是端午节最具代表性的民俗活动，承载着对屈原的纪念和对美好生活的祈愿。\n                    - link:\n                      - /url: /heritage/dragon-boat\n                      - text: 了解详情\n                      - img\n                - generic:\n                  - generic:\n                    - img\n                    - generic: 传统美术\n                    - generic:\n                      - heading [level=3]: 剪纸\n                      - paragraph: Paper Cutting\n                  - generic:\n                    - generic:\n                      - img\n                      - generic: 陕西 · 黄土高原\n                    - paragraph: 剪纸是中国最古老的民间艺术之一，用剪刀或刻刀在纸上剪刻花纹，寓意吉祥美好。\n                    - link:\n                      - /url: /heritage/paper-cutting\n                      - text: 了解详情\n                      - img\n                - generic:\n                  - generic:\n                    - img\n                    - generic: 传统表演\n                    - generic:\n                      - heading [level=3]: 京剧\n                      - paragraph: Peking Opera\n                  - generic:\n                    - generic:\n                      - img\n                      - generic: 北京 · 京城古韵\n                    - paragraph: 京剧是中国影响最大的戏曲剧种，被誉为\"国粹\"，以唱念做打的表演方式闻名于世。\n                    - link:\n                      - /url: /heritage/peking-opera\n                      - text: 了解详情\n                      - img\n                - generic:\n                  - generic:\n                    - img\n                    - generic: 传统表演\n                    - generic:\n                      - heading [level=3]: 昆曲\n                      - paragraph: Kunqu Opera\n                  - generic:\n                    - generic:\n                      - img\n                      - generic: 江苏 · 姑苏雅韵\n                    - paragraph: 昆曲是中国最古老的戏曲剧种之一，被誉为\"百戏之祖\"，以典雅细腻的表演著称。\n                    - link:\n                      - /url: /heritage/kunqu-opera\n                      - text: 了解详情\n                      - img\n                - generic:\n                  - generic:\n                    - img\n                    - generic: 传统美术\n                    - generic:\n                      - heading [level=3]: 书法\n                      - paragraph: Chinese Calligraphy\n                  - generic:\n                    - generic:\n                      - img\n                      - generic: 安徽 · 神州墨韵\n                    - paragraph: 书法是中国特有的艺术形式，以毛笔书写汉字，融合了文字、绘画与哲学的精髓。\n   