                    - generic:\n                      - img\n                      - generic: 北京 · 华夏大地\n                    - paragraph: 春节是中国最重要的传统节日，承载着团圆、祈福、辞旧迎新等丰富的文化内涵。\n                    - link:\n                      - /url: /heritage/spring-festival\n                      - text: 了解详情\n                      - img\n                - generic:\n                  - generic:\n                    - img\n                    - generic: 民俗活动\n                    - generic:\n                      - heading [level=3]: 端午龙舟\n                      - paragraph: Dragon Boat Racing\n                  - generic:\n                    - generic:\n                      - img\n                      - generic: 广东 · 楚地遗风\n                    - paragraph: 龙舟竞渡是端午节最具代表性的民俗活动，承载着对屈原的纪念和对美好生活的祈愿。\n                    - link:\n                      - /url: /heritage/dragon-boat\n                      - text: 了解详情\n                      - img\n                - generic:\n                  - generic:\n                    - img\n                    - generic: 传统工艺\n                    - generic:\n                      - heading [level=3]: 苏绣\n                      - paragraph: Suzhou Embroidery\n                  - generic:\n                    - generic:\n                      - img\n                      - generic: 江苏 · 江南水乡\n                    - paragraph: 苏绣是中国四大名绣之一，以精细雅洁著称，图案秀丽、针法活泼、色彩清雅。\n                    - link:\n                      - /url: /heritage/suzhou-embroidery\n                      - text: 了解详情\n                      - img\n                - generic:\n                  - generic:\n                    - img\n                    - generic: 传统工艺\n                    - generic:\n                      - heading [level=3]: 宜兴紫砂\n                      - paragraph: Yixing Purple Clay\n                  - generic:\n                    - generic:\n                      - img\n                      - generic: 江苏 · 太湖之滨\n                    - paragraph: 宜兴紫砂壶以独特的紫砂泥料制成，造型古朴典